  "notes": "Orchestrator ruling: option (i) returning a persistent buffer is DENIED because compare_case retains v1_output at auto_bench.py:743 and passes it to make_profile_call, so time_forward would overwrite it. Option (ii) allocation reuse with the copy retained is APPROVED: it removes the 16.219 us per-call empty_strided+empty_like host cost (7.4 percent of the 219.792 us wall, clearing the 10.99 us gate) while keeping a fresh non-aliased returned tensor. The residual copy (13.936 + 6.160 + 2.401 = 22.497 us) is the price of correctness and stays."
